Sources of Rust crates with IRIX 6.5 (mips64-sgi-irix, N32) support, for
cargo to use in place of the crates.io releases ([patch.crates-io]) when
cross-building Rust programs for IRIX: so far libc, with an IRIX module
describing IRIX as the IRIX toolchain (clang with its IRIX header wrappers
and builtins) sees it.
